{"title":"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee5a22d54fc169f2c0570c4d726ae0b4ca9b5397.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3k = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f154bd70dc79123db897eaca90fa25c30d0d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{5}k - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/5/ee5a22d54fc169f2c0570c4d726ae0b4ca9b5397.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3k = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/19265a7be317403a362a9d3577837cdbb73fe6d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = \\frac{10}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"58\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in this value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f154bd70dc79123db897eaca90fa25c30d0d7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{5}k - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"56\" height=\"38\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/0/210b402bee107c4d1193c82d02dfbba7169921f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{5} \\times \\frac{10}{3} - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/c/b0c919080970135da2d565184c21fe673e2ea5cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2 \\times 2 - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaf7fddf1e61f692b0a9a5ebed60592ab56e23a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4 - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/2/bd2df5d37ffc0af3866011f5f56f4b4710626b3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC\">2020 CEMC CTMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_CEMC_CTMC_Problems/Individual_Problem_1\" title=\"2020 CEMC CTMC Problems/Individual Problem 1\">Individual P